            <h1 class="form-title govuk-heading-xl">Security check</h1>

<p class="govuk-body">When we notice a high number of visits from a single user, we perform a security check to ensure the user is genuine. This is to keep our services safe from automated systems which are attempting to extract copies of our data (also known as ‘data mining’).</p>
<p class="govuk-body">This security check is required for you to continue to the Intellectual Property Office service.</p>
